{"overview":"فیلمساز جعفر پناهی و بازیگر بهناز جعفری پس از دریافت درخواست کمک از دختری که خانواده‌اش مانع تحصیل در رشته بازیگری او شده، به روستای کوچکی می‌روند. برخوردهای طنزآمیز فراوان است، اما به‌زودی می‌فهمند مهمان‌نوازی محلی به اندازه‌ی تمایل مردم برای حفظ سنت‌های قدیمی است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Filmmaker Jafar Panahi and actor Behnaz Jafari travel to a tiny village after receiving a plea for help from a girl whose family has forbidden her from studying acting. Amusing encounters abound, but they soon discover that the local hospitality is rivaled by the desire to protect old traditions.","tagline_en":"","runtime":100,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["جعفر پناهی"],"crew_en":["Jafar Panahi"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"بهناز جعفری","role":"Behnaz Jafari","photo":"/f5nOCmxRET6DhgMECSp9LS0WK4Y.jpg","en":"Behnaz Jafari"},{"name":"جعفر پناهی","role":"Jafar Panahi","photo":"/viZZkkfcuWze68bvUiMZmYZe8Qg.jpg","en":"Jafar Panahi"},{"name":"Marziyeh Rezaei","role":"Marziyeh","photo":"/87gxaFeSQlNoVQMnRWIh5YodNcs.jpg"},{"name":"Maedeh Erteghaei","role":"Maedeh","photo":""},{"name":"Narges Del Aram","role":"Marziyeh's Mother","photo":""},{"name":"Fatemeh Ismaeilmejad","role":"Old woman in the grave","photo":""},{"name":"Yadollah Dadashnejad","role":"Yadollah","photo":""},{"name":"Ahmad Naderi","role":"Karbalaei","photo":""},{"name":"Hassah Mihammadi","role":"The old man in the road","photo":""},{"name":"Mahdi Panahi","role":"Marziyeh's brother","photo":""},{"name":"Ashgar Aslani","role":"The cow owner","photo":""},{"name":"Elham Hagh Ravan","role":"(voice)","photo":""}],"trailer":"KrBKSxpTG0w","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/517731/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Kino Film Collection","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/vzHdqyLVfEXK6dNIbsVYH28mn9k.png"},{"n":"Kanopy","kind":"free","logo":"/cltb8XKan9ierp23ItPmCOcVLRa.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"rent","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","ki